### 1.3 Barrel Re-export Bomb — `apiServices.ts`
**Severity: Medium**

[apiServices.ts](file:///c:/Users/MyPc/Documents/GitHub/front-nextJs/src/services/apiServices.ts) re-exports **everything** from 20+ API modules:

```typescript
export * from './api/homeApi';
export * from './api/bookApi';
export * from './api/bookManageApi';
